    {
      "id": "adv_math.C3.S01.P005",
      "subject": "高等数学",
      "chapter": "第3章",
      "section": "概览",
      "label": "3.1",
      "title": ".2 求导的例",
      "details": "例3.1.1 求常量函数  $y = C$  的导数\n\n解  $y^\\prime = C^\\prime = \\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{f(x_0 + \\Delta x) - f(x_0)}{\\Delta x} = \\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{C - C}{\\Delta x} = 0.$\n\n例3.1.2 求幂函数  $y = x^{\\alpha} (\\alpha \\neq 0)$ ,  $x \\in (0, +\\infty)$  的导数\n\n解  $y^\\prime = (x^\\alpha)' = \\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{(x + \\Delta x)^\\alpha - x^\\alpha}{\\Delta x} = \\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{x^\\alpha\\left[\\left(1 + \\frac{\\Delta x}{x}\\right)^\\alpha - 1\\right]}{\\Delta x},$  利用  $\\Delta x\\to 0$  时，  $\\left(1 + \\frac{\\Delta x}{x}\\right)^{\\alpha} - 1\\sim \\alpha \\frac{\\Delta x}{x}$  ，可得\n\n$$\ny ^ {\\prime} = \\lim  _ {\\Delta x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac {x ^ {\\alpha} \\alpha \\frac {\\Delta x}{x}}{\\Delta x} = \\alpha x ^ {\\alpha - 1}.\n$$\n\n例3.1.3 求指数函数  $y = a^{x}$  （  $a > 0, a \\neq 1$  ）的导数\n\n解  $y^\\prime = (a^x)^\\prime = \\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{a^{x + \\Delta x} - a^x}{\\Delta x} = \\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{a^x(a^{\\Delta x} - 1)}{\\Delta x}$\n\n$$\n= \\lim  _ {\\Delta x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac {a ^ {x} \\left(\\mathrm {e} ^ {\\Delta x \\ln a} - 1\\right)}{\\Delta x} = \\lim  _ {\\Delta x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac {a ^ {x} \\Delta x \\ln a}{\\Delta x} = a ^ {x} \\ln a.\n$$\n\n特别地, 有  $(\\mathrm{e}^x)' = \\mathrm{e}^x$\n\n例3.1.4 求对数函数  $y = \\log_a x$  ( $a > 0, a \\neq 1$ ) 的导数\n\n解  $y^\\prime = (\\log_ax)' = \\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{\\log_a(x + \\Delta x) - \\log_ax}{\\Delta x} = \\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{\\log_a\\left(1 + \\frac{\\Delta x}{x}\\right)}{\\Delta x}$\n\n$$\n= \\lim  _ {\\Delta x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac {1}{x} \\log_ {a} \\left(1 + \\frac {\\Delta x}{x}\\right) ^ {\\frac {x}{\\Delta x}} = \\frac {1}{x} \\log_ {a} e = \\frac {1}{x \\ln a}.\n$$\n\n特别地,  $(\\ln x)' = \\frac{1}{x}$ .\n\n例3.1.5 求三角函数  $y = \\sin x$  的导数\n\n解  $y^\\prime = (\\sin x)^\\prime = \\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sin(x + \\Delta x) - \\sin x}{\\Delta x} = \\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{2\\sin\\frac{\\Delta x}{2}\\cos\\frac{2x + \\Delta x}{2}}{\\Delta x}$\n\n$$\n= \\lim  _ {\\Delta x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac {\\sin \\frac {\\Delta x}{2}}{\\frac {\\Delta x}{2}} \\lim  _ {\\Delta x \\rightarrow 0} \\cos \\frac {2 x + \\Delta x}{2} = \\cos x.\n...",
