    {
      "id": "adv_math.C3.S01.P015",
      "subject": "高等数学",
      "chapter": "第3章",
      "section": "概览",
      "label": "3.4",
      "title": ".2 由参数方程确定的函数的导数",
      "details": "在实际问题中, 函数  $y$  与自变量  $x$  可能不直接由  $y = f(x)$  表示, 而是通过一参变量  $t$  来确定函数关系, 即给定参数方程\n\n$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} x = \\varphi (t), \\\\ y = \\psi (t). \\end{array} \\right. \\tag {3.4.4}\n$$\n\n如果(3.4.4)式可以确定变量  $y$  是  $\\pmb{x}$  的函数, 称此函数为由参数方程所确定的函数\n\n设  $x = \\varphi(t)$  有连续的反函数  $t = \\varphi^{-1}(x), \\varphi(t), \\psi(t)$  都可导, 且  $\\varphi'(t) \\neq 0$ , 则由复合函数和反函数的求导法则可得\n\n$$\n\\frac {\\mathrm {d} y}{\\mathrm {d} x} = \\frac {\\mathrm {d} y}{\\mathrm {d} t} \\frac {\\mathrm {d} t}{\\mathrm {d} x} = \\frac {\\mathrm {d} y}{\\mathrm {d} t} \\frac {1}{\\frac {\\mathrm {d} x}{\\mathrm {d} t}} = \\frac {\\psi^ {\\prime} (t)}{\\varphi^ {\\prime} (t)}.\n$$\n\n这就是由参数方程确定的函数 (3.4.4) 的求导公式\n\n若  $x = \\varphi (t),y = \\psi (t)$  二阶可导，在求完一阶导数  $\\frac{\\mathrm{dy}}{\\mathrm{dx}}$  后，可设想由参数方程表示函数\n\n$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} x = \\varphi (t), \\\\ \\frac {\\mathrm {d} y}{\\mathrm {d} x} = \\frac {\\psi^ {\\prime} (t)}{\\varphi^ {\\prime} (t)}, \\end{array} \\right.\n$$\n\n再次应用参数方程求导公式, 得\n\n$$\n\\frac {\\mathrm {d} ^ {2} y}{\\mathrm {d} x ^ {2}} = \\frac {\\mathrm {d}}{\\mathrm {d} x} \\left(\\frac {\\mathrm {d} y}{\\mathrm {d} x}\\right) = \\frac {\\frac {\\mathrm {d}}{\\mathrm {d} t} \\left(\\frac {\\mathrm {d} y}{\\mathrm {d} x}\\right)}{\\frac {\\mathrm {d} x}{\\mathrm {d} t}} = \\frac {\\frac {\\mathrm {d}}{\\mathrm {d} t} \\left(\\frac {\\psi^ {\\prime} (t)}{\\varphi^ {\\prime} (t)}\\right)}{\\varphi^ {\\prime} (t)} = \\frac {\\psi^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) \\varphi^ {\\prime} (t) - \\varphi^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) \\psi^ {\\prime} (t)}{[ \\varphi^ {\\prime} (t) ] ^ {3}}.\n$$\n\n例3.4.5 求由摆线的参数方程  $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{ll}x = a(t - \\sin t),\\\\ y = a(1 - \\cos t) \\end{array} \\right.$  所确定的函数  $y = y(x)$  的一阶导数  $\\frac{\\mathrm{dy}}{\\mathrm{dx}}$  和二阶导数  $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2y}{\\mathrm{dx}^2}$\n\n解  $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x} = \\frac{\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}t}}{\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\mathrm{d}t}} = \\frac{a\\sin t}{a(1 - \\cos t)} = \\frac{\\sin t}{1 - \\cos t}$  （ $t \\neq 2n\\pi, n$  为整数），\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\frac {\\mathrm {d} ^ {2} y}{\\mathrm {d} x ^ {2}} = \\frac {\\mathrm {d}}{\\mathrm {d}...",
      "viz": {
