    {
      "id": "adv_math.C5.S01.P015",
      "subject": "高等数学",
      "chapter": "第5章",
      "section": "概览",
      "label": "5.4",
      "title": ".4 不定积分的第二类换元积分法",
      "details": "对于不定积分  $\\int f(x)\\mathrm{d}x$  适当选择变量代换  $x = \\varphi (t)$  ，相应地  $\\mathrm{dx} = \\varphi '(t)\\mathrm{dt}$  若变换  $x = \\varphi (t)$  的逆变换  $t = \\varphi^{-1}(x)$  存在，且较易求得  $f[\\varphi (t)]\\varphi '(t)$  的原函数  $\\Phi (t)$  则可得\n\n$$\n\\int f (x) \\mathrm {d} x = \\int f [ \\varphi (t) ] \\varphi^ {\\prime} (t) \\mathrm {d} t = \\Phi (t) + C = \\Phi [ \\varphi^ {- 1} (x) ] + C.\n$$\n\n这个方法称为第二类换元积分法\n\n例5.4.20 计算  $\\int \\frac{x\\mathrm{d}x}{\\sqrt{x - 3}}.$\n\n解 令  $t = \\sqrt{x - 3}$ , 得  $x = t^2 + 3 (t > 0)$ , 于是\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int \\frac {x \\mathrm {d} x}{\\sqrt {x - 3}} = \\int \\frac {t ^ {2} + 3}{t} 2 t \\mathrm {d} t = 2 \\int (t ^ {2} + 3) \\mathrm {d} t \\\\ = 2 \\left(\\frac {t ^ {3}}{3} + 3 t\\right) + C. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n再将  $t = \\sqrt{x - 3}$  代回, 整理得\n\n$$\n\\int {\\frac {x \\mathrm {d} x}{\\sqrt {x - 3}}} = \\frac {2}{3} (x + 6) (x - 3) ^ {\\frac {1}{2}} + C.\n$$\n\n注 在使用换元积分法后, 请一定记得将原变量代回\n\n例5.4.21 计算  $\\int \\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt[3]{x}}$\n\n解 希望去掉根号, 故令  $x = t^6$ , 于是\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int \\frac {\\mathrm {d} x}{\\sqrt {x} + \\sqrt [ 3 ]{x}} = \\int \\frac {6 t ^ {5}}{t ^ {3} + t ^ {2}} \\mathrm {d} t = 6 \\int \\frac {t ^ {3}}{t + 1} \\mathrm {d} t \\\\ = 6 \\int \\left(t ^ {2} - t + 1 - \\frac {1}{t + 1}\\right) d t \\\\ = 6 \\left(\\frac {t ^ {3}}{3} - \\frac {t ^ {2}}{2} + t - \\ln | t + 1 |\\right) + C \\\\ = 2 \\sqrt {x} - 3 \\sqrt [ 3 ]{x} + 6 \\sqrt [ 6 ]{x} - 6 \\ln (\\sqrt [ 6 ]{x} + 1) + C. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n例5.4.22 计算  $\\int \\sqrt{a^2 - x^2}\\mathrm{d}x(a > 0)$\n\n解 要去根号, 故令  $x = a \\sin t$ ,  $|t| \\leqslant \\frac{\\pi}{2}$ . 则  $\\sqrt{a^2 - x^2} = a |\\cos t| = a \\cos t$ ,  $\\mathrm{d}x = a \\cos t \\mathrm{~d}t$ . 于是\n\n$$\n\\int \\sqrt {a ^ {2} - x ^ {2}} d x = \\int a \\cos t a \\cos t d t = a ^ {2} \\int \\cos^ {2} t d t.\n$$\n\n利用例5.4.14的结果, 得到\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int \\sqrt {a ^ {2} - x ^ {2}} d x = a ^ {2} \\left(\\frac {1}{2} t + \\frac {1}{4} \\sin 2 t\\right) + C \\\\ = \\frac {a ^ {2}}{2} (t + \\sin t \\cos t) + C. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n由于  $x = a\\sin t$  ，因此当  $|t|\\leqslant \\frac{\\pi}{2}$  时有  $t = \\arcsin \\f...",
