    {
      "id": "adv_math.C5.S01.P016",
      "subject": "高等数学",
      "chapter": "第5章",
      "section": "概览",
      "label": "5.4",
      "title": ".5 分部积分法",
      "details": "如果  $u = u(x)$  与  $v = v(x)$  都有连续的导数, 则由函数乘积的微分公式  $\\mathrm{d}(uv) = v\\mathrm{d}u + u\\mathrm{d}v$ , 得  $u\\mathrm{d}v = \\mathrm{d}(uv) - v\\mathrm{d}u$ , 所以有\n\n$$\n\\int u \\mathrm {d} v = u v - \\int v \\mathrm {d} u \\tag {5.4.1}\n$$\n\n或\n\n$$\n\\int u (x) v ^ {\\prime} (x) \\mathrm {d} x = u (x) v (x) - \\int v (x) u ^ {\\prime} (x) \\mathrm {d} x. \\tag {5.4.2}\n$$\n\n公式 (5.4.1) 和 (5.4.2) 称为分部积分公式, 当积分  $\\int u \\mathrm{d}v$  不易计算, 而积分  $\\int v \\mathrm{d}u$  比较容易计算时, 就可以使用这个公式.\n\n例5.4.28 计算  $\\int x\\ln x\\mathrm{d}x$\n\n解 若令  $\\ln x = u, \\mathrm{d}v = x\\mathrm{d}x = \\mathrm{d}\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right)$ , 则\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int x \\ln x \\mathrm {d} x = \\int \\ln x d \\left(\\frac {x ^ {2}}{2}\\right) = \\frac {x ^ {2}}{2} \\ln x - \\int \\frac {x ^ {2}}{2} \\mathrm {d} (\\ln x) \\\\ = \\frac {x ^ {2}}{2} \\ln x - \\int \\frac {x ^ {2}}{2} \\frac {1}{x} \\mathrm {d} x = \\frac {x ^ {2}}{2} \\ln x - \\frac {1}{2} \\int x \\mathrm {d} x \\\\ = \\frac {x ^ {2}}{2} \\ln x - \\frac {x ^ {2}}{4} + C. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n例5.4.29 计算  $\\int x\\cos x\\mathrm{d}x$\n\n解  $\\int x\\cos x\\mathrm{d}x = \\int x\\mathrm{d}\\sin x = x\\sin x - \\int \\sin x\\mathrm{d}x$ $= x\\sin x + \\cos x + C.$\n\n有时被积函数比较复杂, 需要多次运用分部积分才能求得结果.\n\n例5.4.30 计算  $\\int x^{2}\\mathrm{e}^{x}\\mathrm{d}x$\n\n解  $\\int x^{2}\\mathrm{e}^{x}\\mathrm{d}x = \\int x^{2}\\mathrm{d}\\mathrm{e}^{x} = x^{2}\\mathrm{e}^{x} - \\int \\mathrm{e}^{x}\\mathrm{d}x^{2}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} = x ^ {2} \\mathrm {e} ^ {x} - 2 \\int x \\mathrm {e} ^ {x} \\mathrm {d} x = x ^ {2} \\mathrm {e} ^ {x} - 2 \\int x \\mathrm {d e} ^ {x} \\\\ = x ^ {2} \\mathrm {e} ^ {x} - 2 \\left(x \\mathrm {e} ^ {x} - \\int \\mathrm {e} ^ {x} \\mathrm {d} x\\right) = x ^ {2} \\mathrm {e} ^ {x} - 2 \\left(x \\mathrm {e} ^ {x} - \\mathrm {e} ^ {x}\\right) + C \\\\ = \\mathrm {e} ^ {x} (x ^ {2} - 2 x + 2) + C. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n例5.4.31 计算  $\\int \\arctan x\\mathrm{d}x$\n\n解  $\\int \\arctan x\\mathrm{d}x = x\\arctan x - \\int x\\mathrm{d}\\arctan x = x\\arctan x - \\int \\frac{x}{1 + x^2}\\mathrm{d}x$\n\n$$\n= x \\arctan x - \\frac {1}{2} \\ln (1 + x ^ {2}) + C.\n$$\n\n例5.4.32 计...",
