      "label": "5.4",
      "title": ".8 简单无理函数的积分",
      "details": "下面通过例子介绍  $\\sqrt[n]{\\frac{ax + b}{cx + d}}$  和  $x$  的有理式（即由  $\\sqrt[n]{\\frac{ax + b}{cx + d}}, x$  和常数经过有限次四则运算构成的简单无理函数）的不定积分. 这种简单无理函数的不定积分往往可以通过变换\n\n$$\nt = \\sqrt [ n ]{\\frac {a x + b}{c x + d}}\n$$\n\n化成  $t$  的有理函数的不定积分\n\n例5.4.48 计算  $\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\sqrt{\\frac{1 + x}{x}}\\mathrm{d}x.$\n\n解 令  $t = \\sqrt{\\frac{1 + x}{x}}$  ，于是  $t^2 = \\frac{1 + x}{x}, x = \\frac{1}{t^2 - 1}, \\mathrm{d}x = -\\frac{2t}{(t^2 - 1)^2} \\mathrm{d}t.$  从而\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int \\frac {1}{x} \\sqrt {\\frac {1 + x}{x}} \\mathrm {d} x = \\int (t ^ {2} - 1) t \\frac {- 2 t}{(t ^ {2} - 1) ^ {2}} \\mathrm {d} t \\\\ = - 2 \\int \\frac {t ^ {2}}{t ^ {2} - 1} d t = - 2 \\int \\left(1 + \\frac {1}{t ^ {2} - 1}\\right) d t \\\\ = - 2 t - \\ln \\left| \\frac {t - 1}{t + 1} \\right| + C \\\\ = - 2 t + 2 \\ln (t + 1) - \\ln | t ^ {2} - 1 | + C \\\\ = - 2 \\sqrt {\\frac {1 + x}{x}} + 2 \\ln \\left(\\sqrt {\\frac {1 + x}{x}} + 1\\right) + \\ln | x | + C. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n例5.4.49 计算  $\\int \\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\sqrt[3]{(x - 1)^2(x + 2)}}.$\n\n解 由于  $\\sqrt[3]{(x - 1)^2(x + 2)} = (x + 2)\\sqrt[3]{\\left(\\frac{x - 1}{x + 2}\\right)^2}$ , 若令  $t^3 = \\frac{x - 1}{x + 2}$ , 则有\n\n$$\nx = \\frac {1 + 2 t ^ {3}}{1 - t ^ {3}}, \\quad \\mathrm {d} x = \\frac {9 t ^ {2}}{(1 - t ^ {3}) ^ {2}} \\mathrm {d} t.\n$$\n\n代入原式, 化简得\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int \\frac {\\mathrm {d} x}{\\sqrt [ 3 ]{(x - 1) ^ {2} (x + 2)}} = \\int \\frac {3}{1 - t ^ {3}} \\mathrm {d} t = \\int \\left(\\frac {1}{1 - t} + \\frac {t + 2}{1 + t + t ^ {2}}\\right) \\mathrm {d} t \\\\ = - \\ln | 1 - t | + \\frac {1}{2} \\int \\frac {1 + 2 t}{1 + t + t ^ {2}} \\mathrm {d} t + \\frac {3}{2} \\int \\frac {\\mathrm {d} t}{\\frac {3}{4} + \\left(\\frac {1}{2} + t\\right) ^ {2}} \\\\ = - \\ln | 1 - t | + \\frac {1}{2} \\ln | 1 + t + t ^ {2} | + \\sqrt {3} \\arctan \\frac {1 + 2 t}{\\sqrt {3}} + C ^ {\\prime} \\\\ = - \\frac {3}{2} \\ln | \\sqrt [ 3 ]{x + 2} - \\sqrt [ 3 ]{x - 1} | \\\\ + \\sqrt {3} \\arctan \\frac {\\sqrt [ 3 ]{x + 2} + 2 \\sqrt [ 3 ]{x - 1}}{\\sqrt {3} \\sqrt [ 3 ]{x + 2}} + C. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n# 习题 5.4\n\n1. 计算下列不定积分：\n\n(1)  $\\int \\left(\\sqrt...",
