    {
      "id": "adv_math.C5.S01.P021",
      "subject": "高等数学",
      "chapter": "第5章",
      "section": "概览",
      "label": "5.5",
      "title": ".1 直接利用牛顿-莱布尼茨公式",
      "details": "例5.5.1 求定积分  $\\int_{-1}^{1}\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{1 + x^2}$  的值\n\n解 根据基本积分和牛顿-莱布尼茨公式, 得\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int_ {- 1} ^ {1} \\frac {\\mathrm {d} x}{1 + x ^ {2}} = \\left. \\arctan x \\right| _ {- 1} ^ {1} = \\arctan 1 - \\arctan (- 1) \\\\ = \\frac {\\pi}{4} - \\left(- \\frac {\\pi}{4}\\right) = \\frac {\\pi}{2}. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n例5.5.2 计算定积分  $\\int_{-1}^{3}|2 - x|\\mathrm{d}x.$\n\n解 由于被积函数有绝对值, 先将绝对值去掉, 再分区间积分. 因为\n\n$$\n| 2 - x | = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} 2 - x, & x \\leqslant 2, \\\\ x - 2, & x > 2, \\end{array} \\right.\n$$\n\n由定积分的可加性, 得\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int_ {- 1} ^ {3} | 2 - x | \\mathrm {d} x = \\int_ {- 1} ^ {2} (2 - x) \\mathrm {d} x + \\int_ {2} ^ {3} (x - 2) \\mathrm {d} x \\\\ = \\left. \\left(2 x - \\frac {1}{2} x ^ {2}\\right) \\right| _ {- 1} ^ {2} + \\left(\\frac {x ^ {2}}{2} - 2 x\\right) \\bigg | _ {2} ^ {3} \\\\ = 4 \\frac {1}{2} + \\frac {1}{2} = 5. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n例5.5.3 计算  $\\int_0^\\pi \\sqrt{1 - \\sin^2x}\\mathrm{d}x.$\n\n解  $\\int_0^\\pi \\sqrt{1 - \\sin^2x}\\mathrm{d}x = \\int_0^\\pi \\sqrt{\\cos^2x}\\mathrm{d}x = \\int_0^\\pi |\\cos x|\\mathrm{d}x$\n\n$$\n= \\int_ {0} ^ {\\frac {\\pi}{2}} \\cos x d x + \\int_ {\\frac {\\pi}{2}} ^ {\\pi} (- \\cos x) d x\n$$\n\n$$\n= \\sin x \\left| _ {0} ^ {\\frac {\\pi}{2}} - \\sin x \\right| _ {\\frac {\\pi}{2}} = 2.\n$$",
      "viz": {
        "viz_id": "integral_visualizer",
        "viz_desc": "积分可视化组件",
        "tech": [
          "D3.js",
          "Rough.js"
        ]
      },
      "ui_binding": {
        "project_path": [
