    {
      "id": "adv_math.C5.S01.P023",
      "subject": "高等数学",
      "chapter": "第5章",
      "section": "概览",
      "label": "5.5",
      "title": ".3 定积分的分部积分法",
      "details": "由不定积分的分部积分公式, 马上可得定积分的分部积分公式为\n\n$$\n\\int_ {a} ^ {b} u (x) \\mathrm {d} v (x) = [ u (x) v (x) ] \\Big | _ {a} ^ {b} - \\int_ {a} ^ {b} v (x) \\mathrm {d} u (x). \\tag {5.5.2}\n$$\n\n分部积分法的要点就是通过微分交换, 使得右边的积分比左边容易找到原函数.\n\n例5.5.11 计算  $\\int_0^2 x\\mathrm{e}^x\\mathrm{d}x$  和  $\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}x^2\\cos x\\mathrm{d}x.$\n\n解  $\\int_0^2 x\\mathrm{e}^x\\mathrm{d}x = \\int_0^2 x\\mathrm{d}\\mathrm{e}^x = x\\mathrm{e}^x\\Big|_0^2 -\\int_0^2\\mathrm{e}^x\\mathrm{d}x$\n\n$$\n= 2 \\mathrm {e} ^ {2} - \\mathrm {e} ^ {x} \\Big | _ {0} ^ {2} = \\mathrm {e} ^ {2} + 1.\n$$\n\n请读者计算后一个积分.\n\n例5.5.12 计算  $\\int_{\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{e}}}^{\\mathrm{e}}|\\ln x|\\mathrm{d}x$  和  $\\int_{1}^{\\mathrm{e}}x^{2}\\ln x\\mathrm{d}x.$\n\n解  $\\int_{\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{e}}}^{\\mathrm{e}}|\\ln x|\\mathrm{d}x = -\\int_{\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{e}}}^{\\mathrm{l}}\\ln x\\mathrm{d}x + \\int_{1}^{\\mathrm{e}}\\ln x\\mathrm{d}x$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} = - \\left(x \\ln x \\Big | _ {\\frac {1}{e}} ^ {1} - \\int_ {\\frac {1}{e}} ^ {1} d x\\right) + x \\ln x \\Big | _ {1} ^ {e} - \\int_ {1} ^ {e} d x \\\\ = - \\frac {1}{\\mathrm {e}} + \\left(1 - \\frac {1}{\\mathrm {e}}\\right) + \\mathrm {e} - (\\mathrm {e} - 1) = 2 - \\frac {2}{\\mathrm {e}}. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n请通过计算  $\\int_{1}^{\\mathrm{e}}x^{2}\\ln x\\mathrm{d}x$  ，找出含有对数函数的分部积分的规律\n\n例5.5.13 设  $I_{n} = \\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\sin^{n}x\\mathrm{d}x,$  证明\n\n$$\nI _ {n} = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} { \\frac {n - 1}{n} \\cdot \\frac {n - 3 \\cdots 3}{n - 2 \\cdots 4} \\cdot \\frac {1}{2} \\cdot \\frac {\\pi}{2},} & {n \\text {为 正 偶 数},} \\\\ { \\frac {n - 1}{n} \\cdot \\frac {n - 3 \\cdots 4}{n - 2 \\cdots 5} \\cdot \\frac {2}{3},} & {n \\text {为 大 于} 1 \\text {的 正 奇 数}.} \\end{array} \\right.\n$$\n\n证 当  $n \\geqslant 2$  时，\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} I _ {n} = \\int_ {0} ^ {\\frac {\\pi}{2}} \\sin^ {n - 1} x \\mathrm {d} (- \\cos x) \\\\ = - (\\sin^ {n - 1} x \\cos x) \\left| \\begin{array}{l} \\frac {\\pi}{2} \\\\ 0 \\end{array} + (n - 1) \\int_ {0} ^ {\\frac {\\pi}{2}} \\cos^ {2} x \\sin^ {n - 2} x \\mathrm {d} x \\right. \\\\ = (n - 1) \\int_ {0} ^ {\\frac {\\pi}{2}} (1 - \\sin^ {2} x) \\sin^ {n - 2} x d x \\\\ = ...",
      "viz": {
        "viz_id": "integral_visualizer",
        "viz_desc": "积分可视化组件",
        "tech": [
          "D3.js",
          "Rough.js"
        ]
