        "imported_at": "2026-03-15T13:30:50.785021",
        "version": "1.0"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "adv_math.C5.S01.P025",
      "subject": "高等数学",
      "chapter": "第5章",
      "section": "概览",
      "label": "5.6",
      "title": ".1 矩形法",
      "details": "矩形法与定积分定义类似, 将定积分对应的曲边梯形分成若干个窄的小曲边梯形, 以直边代替小曲边梯形的顶部曲边, 用小矩形代替小曲边梯形, 这些小矩形面积的和就是定积分的近似值 (图5.9).\n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-02-01/5add63f4-89d6-4fd1-aeb4-cee580c4b3d7/3637db1a9a2b7aecf717cf992a210904d15f58e7736e284e59e8348d1df9148e.jpg)\n\n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-02-01/5add63f4-89d6-4fd1-aeb4-cee580c4b3d7/989984371ee763c6c050b01bb7720f8d10f32d7d2e5bd6ac5116a34d7df36f4f.jpg)\n\n\n\n图5.9\n\n\n具体方法如下：\n\n将积分区间  $[a,b]n$  等分，分点为\n\n$$\na = x _ {0} <   x _ {1} <   \\dots <   x _ {n - 1} <   x _ {n} = b,\n$$\n\n每个小区间长度为  $\\Delta x = \\frac{b - a}{n}$ . 设  $y_{i} = f(x_{i})$  ( $i = 1,2,\\dots,n$ ) 是分点  $x_{i}$  的函数值，取小区间的左端点或右端点的函数值作为小矩形的高，这样  $n$  个小矩形的面积分别是  $y_{i-1}\\Delta x$  或  $y_{i}\\Delta x$  ( $i = 1,2,\\dots,n$ ). 于是\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int_ {a} ^ {b} f (x) \\mathrm {d} x \\approx \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {n} y _ {i - 1} \\Delta x = \\Delta x \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {n} y _ {i - 1} \\tag {5.6.1} \\\\ = \\frac {b - a}{n} \\left(y _ {0} + y _ {1} + \\dots + y _ {n - 1}\\right), \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n或\n\n$$\n\\int_ {a} ^ {b} f (x) \\mathrm {d} x \\approx \\frac {b - a}{n} \\left(y _ {1} + y _ {2} + \\dots + y _ {n}\\right). \\tag {5.6.1'}\n$$\n\n公式(5.6.1)、  $(5.6.1^{\\prime})$  都称为定积分的矩形近似公式",
      "viz": {
        "viz_id": "integral_visualizer",
        "viz_desc": "积分可视化组件",
        "tech": [
          "D3.js",
          "Rough.js"
        ]
      },
      "ui_binding": {
