          ".1",
          "面积分",
          "矩形法"
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "source_file": "05_第5章_积分.md",
        "imported_at": "2026-03-15T13:30:50.785049",
        "version": "1.0"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "adv_math.C5.S01.P026",
      "subject": "高等数学",
      "chapter": "第5章",
      "section": "概览",
      "label": "5.6",
      "title": ".2 梯形法",
      "details": "如果在每个小区间  $[x_{i - 1}, x_i]$  上用小梯形面积  $\\frac{\\Delta x}{2} (y_{i - 1} + y_i)$  代替小曲边梯形面积, 就得到了定积分的梯形近似公式 (图5.10):\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int_ {a} ^ {b} f (x) \\mathrm {d} x \\approx \\frac {\\Delta x}{2} \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {n} \\left(y _ {i - 1} + y _ {i}\\right) \\\\ = \\frac {b - a}{n} \\left(\\frac {y _ {0} + y _ {n}}{2} + y _ {1} + y _ {2} + \\dots + y _ {n - 1}\\right). \\tag {5.6.2} \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-02-01/5add63f4-89d6-4fd1-aeb4-cee580c4b3d7/eaae12110cbfeb6f8c844b26bab118d412f494b304391ff670c1f53e0b78ad96.jpg)\n\n\n\n图5.10\n\n\n梯形近似公式实际上是两个矩形公式 (5.6.1) 和  $(5.6.1^{\\prime})$  的平均值, 所以比矩形公式更精确一些.\n\n例5.6.1 用矩形法和梯形法计算定积分  $\\int_0^1\\mathrm{e}^{-x^2}\\mathrm{d}x$  的近似值（取  $n = 10$ ）\n\n解 将  $[0,1]$  分成 10 等分，分点为  $x_{i} = \\frac{i}{10} (i = 1,2,\\dots ,10)$ . 小区间长度  $\\Delta x = \\frac{1}{10}$ ，分点的函数值  $y_{i} = \\mathrm{e}^{-x_{i}^{2}} (i = 1,2,\\dots ,n)$ . 用计算器计算可得\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} y _ {0} = 1. 0 0 0 0 0, \\quad y _ {1} = 0. 9 9 0 0 5, \\quad y _ {2} = 0. 9 6 0 7 9, \\quad y _ {3} = 0. 9 1 3 9 3, \\\\ y _ {4} = 0. 8 5 2 1 4, \\quad y _ {5} = 0. 7 7 8 8 0, \\quad y _ {6} = 0. 6 9 7 6 8, \\quad y _ {7} = 0. 6 1 2 6 3, \\\\ y _ {8} = 0. 5 2 7 2 9, \\quad y _ {9} = 0. 4 4 4 8 6, \\quad y _ {1 0} = 0. 3 6 7 8 8. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n由公式 (5.6.1) 得\n\n$$\n\\int_ {0} ^ {1} \\mathrm {e} ^ {- x ^ {2}} \\mathrm {d} x \\approx \\frac {1}{1 0} (y _ {0} + y _ {1} + \\dots + y _ {9}) \\approx 0. 7 7 7 8 2.\n$$\n\n由公式  $(5.6.1^{\\prime})$  得\n\n$$\n\\int_ {0} ^ {1} \\mathrm {e} ^ {- x ^ {2}} \\mathrm {d} x \\approx \\frac {1}{1 0} (y _ {1} + y _ {2} + \\dots + y _ {1 0}) \\approx 0. 7 1 4 6 1.\n$$\n\n求上面两式的平均值，得梯形公式的近似值为\n\n$$\n\\int_ {0} ^ {1} \\mathrm {e} ^ {- x ^ {2}} \\mathrm {d} x \\approx \\frac {1}{2} (0. 7 7 7 8 2 + 0. 7 1 4 6 1) \\approx 0. 7 4 6 2 1.\n$$\n\n如果在矩形公式中不是用端点函数值作为矩形的高，而是用小区间的中点作为小区间的高，计算精度将大大提高.设  $\\bar{x}_i = \\frac{x_{i - 1} + x_i}{2}$ $(i = 1,2,\\dots ,n)$  ，则\n\n$$\n\\int_ {0} ^ {1} f (x) \\mathrm {d} x = \\Delta x \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {n} f (\\bar {x} _ {i}). \\tag {5.6.3}\n$$\n\n关于梯形公式和矩形中点公式的计算...",
      "viz": {
        "viz_id": "integral_visualizer",
        "viz_desc": "积分可视化组件",
        "tech": [
          "D3.js",
          "Rough.js"
        ]
      },
      "ui_binding": {
        "project_path": [
          "高等数学",
          "第5章",
          "概览"
        ],
        "default_view_id": "integral_visualizer",
        "search_keywords": [
          "函数",
          "积分",
          "公式",
          "梯形法",
          ".2"
