    },
    {
      "id": "adv_math.C6.S01.P010",
      "subject": "高等数学",
      "chapter": "第6章",
      "section": "概览",
      "label": "1",
      "title": ". 直角坐标情形",
      "details": "设曲线弧由直角坐标方程\n\n$$\ny = f (x) \\quad (a \\leqslant x \\leqslant b)\n$$\n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-02-01/5add63f4-89d6-4fd1-aeb4-cee580c4b3d7/71918bf5c5d643a829b84441fa151dcdc45ebd6b1e1ec2b0caaeb7bcf3a31566.jpg)\n\n\n\n图6.15\n\n\n给出, 其中  $f(x)$  在  $[a,b]$  上具有一阶连续导数 (保证曲线可求长)(图6.16). 现在来计算这曲线弧的长度.\n\n取横坐标  $x$  为积分变量，它的变化区间为  $[a,b]$  曲线  $y = f(x)$  上相应于  $[a,b]$  上的任一小区间  $[x,x + \\mathrm{d}x]$  的一段弧的长度，可以用该曲线在点  $(x,f(x))$  处的切线上相应的一小段长度来近似代替，从而得到弧长的微分\n\n$$\n\\mathrm {d} s = \\sqrt {(\\mathrm {d} x) ^ {2} + (\\mathrm {d} y) ^ {2}} = \\sqrt {1 + (y ^ {\\prime}) ^ {2}} \\mathrm {d} x.\n$$\n\n于是弧长为\n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-02-01/5add63f4-89d6-4fd1-aeb4-cee580c4b3d7/5962209d88883e25f2c152cb893ddb83f43f43a77e4a361f5eb839271e4f05ae.jpg)\n\n\n\n图6.16\n\n\n$$\ns = \\int_ {a} ^ {b} \\sqrt {1 + (y ^ {\\prime}) ^ {2}} d x. \\tag {6.4.1}\n$$\n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-02-01/5add63f4-89d6-4fd1-aeb4-cee580c4b3d7/28f8b7ea266d8b2519054a54022a5a9e5fe426c098b539de66d56ac55122ca37.jpg)\n\n\n\n图6.17\n\n\n例6.4.1 求悬链线  $y = \\frac{a}{2}\\left(\\mathrm{e}^{\\frac{x}{a}} + \\mathrm{e}^{-\\frac{x}{a}}\\right), a > 0$  在区间  $[-a, a]$  上的弧段的弧长（图6.17）\n\n解 由于\n\n$$\n\\sqrt {1 + y ^ {\\prime 2}} = \\sqrt {1 + \\frac {1}{4} \\left(\\mathrm {e} ^ {\\frac {x}{a}} - \\mathrm {e} ^ {- \\frac {x}{a}}\\right) ^ {2}} = \\frac {1}{2} \\left(\\mathrm {e} ^ {\\frac {x}{a}} + \\mathrm {e} ^ {- \\frac {x}{a}}\\right),\n$$\n\n因此弧长为\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} s = 2 \\int_ {0} ^ {a} \\frac {1}{2} \\left(\\mathrm {e} ^ {\\frac {x}{a}} + \\mathrm {e} ^ {- \\frac {x}{a}}\\right) \\mathrm {d} x \\\\ = a \\left(\\mathrm {e} ^ {\\frac {x}{a}} - \\mathrm {e} ^ {- \\frac {x}{a}}\\right) \\Big | _ {0} ^ {a} = a \\left(\\mathrm {e} - \\mathrm {e} ^ {- 1}\\right). \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$",
      "viz": {
        "viz_id": "derivative_visualizer",
        "viz_desc": "导数可视化组件",
        "tech": [
          "D3.js",
          "KaTeX"
        ]
      },
      "ui_binding": {
        "project_path": [
          "高等数学",
          "第6章",
          "概览"
        ],
        "default_view_id": "derivative_visualizer",
        "search_keywords": [
          "曲线",
          "方程",
          "积分",
