    },
    {
      "id": "adv_math.C6.S01.P011",
      "subject": "高等数学",
      "chapter": "第6章",
      "section": "概览",
      "label": "2",
      "title": ". 参数方程情形",
      "details": "当曲线由参数方程\n\n$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} x = \\varphi (t), \\\\ y = \\psi (t), \\end{array} \\right. \\qquad \\alpha \\leqslant t \\leqslant \\beta\n$$\n\n表达时，弧微分为\n\n$$\n\\mathrm {d} s = \\sqrt {(\\mathrm {d} x) ^ {2} + (\\mathrm {d} y) ^ {2}} = \\sqrt {\\varphi^ {\\prime 2} (t) + \\psi^ {\\prime 2} (t)} \\mathrm {d} t.\n$$\n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-02-01/5add63f4-89d6-4fd1-aeb4-cee580c4b3d7/e598e79d581a846637d114c4ca46e8d7aee453430f0ccf8c7effc0d3174d621f.jpg)\n\n\n\n图6.18\n\n\n因此, 当  $\\varphi(t), \\psi(t)$  在  $[\\alpha, \\beta]$  上都有连续导数且  $\\varphi'^2(t) + \\psi'^2(t) \\neq 0$  时, 曲线的弧长计算公式为\n\n$$\ns = \\int_ {\\alpha} ^ {\\beta} \\sqrt {\\varphi^ {\\prime 2} (t) + \\psi^ {\\prime 2} (t)} \\mathrm {d} t, \\qquad (6. 4. 2)\n$$\n\n其中条件  $\\varphi^{\\prime}(t),\\psi^{\\prime}(t)$  连续保证曲线可求长，即定积分存在.\n\n例6.4.2 计算星形线\n\n$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} x = a \\cos^ {3} t, \\\\ y = a \\sin^ {3} t, \\end{array} \\right. \\qquad \\qquad 0 \\leqslant t \\leqslant 2 \\pi\n$$\n\n的周长 (图6.18).\n\n解 弧微分为\n\n$$\n\\mathrm {d} s = \\sqrt {\\left[ (a \\cos^ {3} t) ^ {\\prime} \\right] ^ {2} + \\left[ (a \\sin^ {3} t) ^ {\\prime} \\right] ^ {2}} \\mathrm {d} t = 3 | \\sin t \\cos t | \\mathrm {d} t,\n$$\n\n从而，所求弧长为\n\n$$\ns = 4 \\int_ {0} ^ {\\frac {\\pi}{2}} 3 \\sin t \\cos t \\mathrm {d} t = 6 a.\n$$",
      "viz": {
        "viz_id": "derivative_visualizer",
        "viz_desc": "导数可视化组件",
        "tech": [
          "D3.js",
          "KaTeX"
        ]
      },
      "ui_binding": {
        "project_path": [
          "高等数学",
          "第6章",
          "概览"
        ],
        "default_view_id": "derivative_visualizer",
        "search_keywords": [
