    {
      "id": "adv_math.C6.S01.P012",
      "subject": "高等数学",
      "chapter": "第6章",
      "section": "概览",
      "label": "3",
      "title": ". 极坐标情形",
      "details": "若曲线由极坐标\n\n$$\nr = r (\\theta) \\quad (\\alpha \\leqslant \\theta \\leqslant \\beta)\n$$\n\n给出, 则相当于以  $\\theta$  为参数的曲线弧:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} x = r (\\theta) \\cos \\theta , \\\\ y = r (\\theta) \\sin \\theta , \\end{array} \\right. \\qquad \\alpha \\leqslant \\theta \\leqslant \\beta .\n$$\n\n于是弧微分为\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\mathrm {d} s = \\sqrt {x ^ {\\prime 2} (\\theta) + y ^ {\\prime 2} (\\theta)} \\mathrm {d} \\theta \\\\ = \\sqrt {\\left[ r ^ {\\prime} (\\theta) \\cos \\theta - r (\\theta) \\sin \\theta \\right] ^ {2} + \\left[ r ^ {\\prime} (\\theta) \\sin \\theta + r (\\theta) \\cos \\theta \\right] ^ {2}} \\mathrm {d} \\theta \\\\ = \\sqrt {r ^ {2} (\\theta) + r ^ {\\prime 2} (\\theta)} d \\theta . \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n所求弧长为\n\n$$\ns = \\int_ {\\alpha} ^ {\\beta} \\sqrt {r ^ {2} (\\theta) + r ^ {\\prime 2} (\\theta)} d \\theta . \\tag {6.4.3}\n$$\n\n例6.4.3 求对数螺线  $r = \\mathrm{e}^{a\\theta}$  相应于  $\\theta = 0$  到  $\\theta = \\varphi$  的一段弧长（图6.19）\n\n解 弧长微分为\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\mathrm {d} s = \\sqrt {r ^ {2} (\\theta) + r ^ {\\prime 2} (\\theta)} \\mathrm {d} \\theta = \\sqrt {\\left(\\mathrm {e} ^ {a \\theta}\\right) ^ {2} + \\left(a \\mathrm {e} ^ {a \\theta}\\right) ^ {2}} \\mathrm {d} \\theta \\\\ = \\sqrt {1 + a ^ {2}} e ^ {a \\theta} d \\theta , \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-02-01/5add63f4-89d6-4fd1-aeb4-cee580c4b3d7/652ee60e7b9fa39242e56fe3dc5c71ff9dc54ee71f8a97528b39209967b4befe.jpg)\n\n\n\n图6.19\n\n\n于是所求弧长为\n\n$$\ns = \\int_ {0} ^ {\\varphi} \\sqrt {1 + a ^ {2}} \\mathrm {e} ^ {a \\theta} \\mathrm {d} \\theta = \\frac {\\sqrt {1 + a ^ {2}}}{a} (\\mathrm {e} ^ {a \\dot {\\varphi}} - 1).\n$$",
      "viz": {
        "viz_id": "info_card",
        "viz_desc": "概念卡片/步骤推导",
        "tech": [
          "Markdown",
          "MathJax"
        ]
      },
      "ui_binding": {
        "project_path": [
          "高等数学",
          "第6章",
