    {
      "id": "adv_math.C7.S01.P004",
      "subject": "高等数学",
      "chapter": "第7章",
      "section": "概览",
      "label": "7.2",
      "title": ".2 向量的坐标 向量运算的坐标表示",
      "details": "设直角坐标系  $Oxyz$ , 沿  $x$  轴、 $y$  轴和  $z$  轴正向的三个单位向量称为坐标向量, 分别记作  $\\pmb{i}, \\pmb{j}$  和  $\\pmb{k}$ .\n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-02-01/5add63f4-89d6-4fd1-aeb4-cee580c4b3d7/f55470eebc508739cc24e5e0b31647fdefcab5c73f3ef82a05250bb7ca7082a5.jpg)\n\n\n\n图7.8\n\n\n设向量  $\\overrightarrow{OP}$  的终点为  $P(x,y,z)$ ，称  $\\overrightarrow{OP}$  为点  $P$  的位置向量。由7.1节中图7.3的作法可得图7.8。\n\n由加法定义可知\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\overrightarrow {O P} = \\overrightarrow {O A} + \\overrightarrow {A Q} + \\overrightarrow {Q P} \\\\ = \\overrightarrow {O A} + \\overrightarrow {O B} + \\overrightarrow {O C}. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n由数乘向量定义，得\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow {O A} = x \\mathbf {i}, \\quad \\overrightarrow {O B} = y \\mathbf {j}, \\quad \\overrightarrow {O C} = z \\mathbf {k},\n$$\n\n故\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow {O P} = x \\boldsymbol {i} + y \\boldsymbol {j} + z \\boldsymbol {k}.\n$$\n\n简记为  $\\overrightarrow{OP} = (x,y,z)$ , 且称向量  $\\overrightarrow{OP}$  的坐标为  $(x,y,z)$ . 因此, 点  $P$  的位置向量的坐标与点  $P$  的坐标相同. 显然\n\n$$\n\\boldsymbol {i} = (1, 0, 0), \\quad \\boldsymbol {j} = (0, 1, 0), \\quad \\boldsymbol {k} = (0, 0, 1).\n$$\n\n下面用坐标来表示向量的线性运算\n\n设  $\\pmb{a} = (a_{1}, a_{2}, a_{3}), \\pmb{b} = (b_{1}, b_{2}, b_{3}), \\lambda$  是实数, 则\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\boldsymbol {a} \\pm \\boldsymbol {b} = \\left(a _ {1} \\boldsymbol {i} + a _ {2} \\boldsymbol {j} + a _ {3} \\boldsymbol {k}\\right) \\pm \\left(b _ {1} \\boldsymbol {i} + b _ {2} \\boldsymbol {j} + b _ {3} \\boldsymbol {k}\\right) \\\\ = \\left(a _ {1} \\pm b _ {1}\\right) \\boldsymbol {i} + \\left(a _ {2} \\pm b _ {2}\\right) \\boldsymbol {j} + \\left(a _ {3} \\pm b _ {3}\\right) \\boldsymbol {k}, \\\\ \\lambda \\boldsymbol {a} = \\lambda \\left(a _ {1} \\boldsymbol {i} + a _ {2} \\boldsymbol {j} + a _ {3} \\boldsymbol {k}\\right) = \\lambda a _ {1} \\boldsymbol {i} + \\lambda a _ {2} \\boldsymbol {j} + \\lambda a _ {3} \\boldsymbol {k}, \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n即\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\boldsymbol {a} \\pm \\boldsymbol {b} = (a _ {1} \\pm b _ {1}, a _ {2} \\pm b _ {2}, a _ {3} \\pm b _ {3}), \\\\ \\lambda \\boldsymbol {a} = (\\lambda a _ {1...",
      "viz": {
        "viz_id": "vector_lab",
        "viz_desc": "向量可视化组件",
